      "baseline": "每个维度使用同一活动资格、组别、结果窗和比较设计；只在互斥返回切片内汇总，不跨维度叠加贡献。",
      "contribution_formula": "impact_s = eligible_s * (outcome_rate_campaign_s - outcome_rate_comparison_s); contribution_s = impact_s / sum(impact_returned_s)，总和为零时不输出占比。",
